# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms)
#
# The site is prerendered to static HTML and served by GitHub Pages, so there is
# no server runtime. The contact form posts directly to Web3Forms from the
# browser, and Web3Forms emails the enquiry on to the business.
#
# Get a key: https://web3forms.com — enter safehaveninspectionsllc@gmail.com and
# the access key is emailed back. No account or password required.
#
# This key is PUBLIC by design: it is baked into the client bundle at build time
# and can only post to the one inbox it was issued for. It is not a secret, so
# committing it is fine. Set the same value as a GitHub Actions repository
# variable named VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY so CI builds pick it up.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
